---
title: Archiving a price
endpoint: /prices/{price_id}
method: delete
---

This endpoint archives a price in your connected Stripe account, making it unavailable for new subscriptions. Stripe prices are immutable and can't be deleted outright, so this deactivates the price instead; existing subscriptions on it are untouched.

Note that a product's default price can't be archived — set a different default price first.
